  "title": "v1.132.0",
  "summary": "What's Changed Drop package.json version by @vineyardbovines in #11516 Add Blink Prometheus listener by @amckinley in #11509 Fix \"Tried to synchronously call a Remote Function\" crash by @tomekzaw in #11517 Add graceful shutdown to Blink by @amckinley in #11523 Make Safelink event replay idempotent by @amckinley in #11524 Back to v1.132.0 by @mozzius in #115…",
  "content": "<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Drop package.json version by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11516\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11516</a></li>\n<li>Add Blink Prometheus listener by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11509\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11509</a></li>\n<li>Fix &quot;Tried to synchronously call a Remote Function&quot; crash by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11517\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11517</a></li>\n<li>Add graceful shutdown to Blink by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11523</a></li>\n<li>Make Safelink event replay idempotent by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11524\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11524</a></li>\n<li>Back to v1.132.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11522\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11522</a></li>\n<li>Fix hairline divider not visible by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11518\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11518</a></li>\n<li>Reland &quot;Bump React Compiler to stable 1.0.0&quot; by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11525</a></li>\n<li>[AA] Set <code>maxAge: Infinity</code> on age assurance cache by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11526\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11526</a></li>\n<li>Adds a small padding for labeller avatars in group chat &#x27;Add people&#x27; selector by <a href=\"https://github.com/RetroSunstar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@RetroSunstar</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11422\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11422</a></li>\n<li>Explain trending topics in options menu by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11521\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11521</a></li>\n<li>[APP-2922] Fix cached starter pack navigation by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11531\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11531</a></li>\n<li>Overfetch trending topics before filtering by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11477\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11477</a></li>\n<li>Revert &quot;Send beta user state with AppView requests (<a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11474\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11474</a>)&quot; by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11510\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11510</a></li>\n<li>Fix iOS message input height after sending by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11533</a></li>\n<li>Send an integer exp for video upload service auth tokens by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11529\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11529</a></li>\n<li>Update tech stack versions and fix markdown in CLAUDE.md  by <a href=\"https://github.com/surfdude29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@surfdude29</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11530\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11530</a></li>\n<li>Bump the actions group with 2 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11537\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11537</a></li>\n<li>Enable React Native strict TypeScript API by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11459\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11459</a></li>\n<li>[APP-2864] Use hydrated known likers by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11541\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11541</a></li>\n<li>Add OP thread numbering to feed posts by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11472\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11472</a></li>\n<li>Create moderation inbox menu item and feature gate by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11552\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11552</a></li>\n<li>Remove multipart upload and 10-minute video feature gates by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11528</a></li>\n<li>Remove legacy ota1 publisher by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11554\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11554</a></li>\n<li>Fix site initialization in older versions of Safari by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11553\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11553</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>URL.canParse</code> in older browsers by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11557</a></li>\n<li>Update video embed lexicon by <a href=\"https://github.com/blackmichael\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@blackmichael</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11559</a></li>\n<li>Update algorithmic recommendations helper text by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11546\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11546</a></li>\n<li>Fix starter pack navigation from search and explore by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11563\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11563</a></li>\n<li>Fix auto handle resolution during sign in by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11567\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11567</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for 13 components by hoisting finally blocks by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11540\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11540</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for 4 components with deferred ref access by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11549\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11549</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for 6 components by removing render-phase ref access by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11544\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11544</a></li>\n<li>Fix pagination by <a href=\"https://github.com/rafaeleyng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@rafaeleyng</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11448\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11448</a></li>\n<li>Handle AppView errors after quote posts by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11579\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11579</a></li>\n<li>APP-2971: Fix onboarding avatar compression after Expo 57 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11580\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11580</a></li>\n<li>Fix support link cutoff in signup footer on mobile by <a href=\"https://github.com/surfdude29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@surfdude29</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11059\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11059</a></li>\n<li>Keep chat reaction bar on screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11532</a></li>\n<li>Forward labeler headers to chat by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11555\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11555</a></li>\n<li>Target Android 16 (API 36) by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11576\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11576</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@bsky/sdk</code> to latest by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11597\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11597</a></li>\n<li>APP-2976: Remove react-native-compressor remnants by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11588\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11588</a></li>\n<li>Add city to IP-based geo by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11603\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11603</a></li>\n<li>Tweak alignment of thread numbering by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11566\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11566</a></li>\n<li>Patch formatjs BigDecimal to stop dividing by 1 on every number format by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11610\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11610</a></li>\n<li>Remove Live Now new-feature nudge by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11604\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11604</a></li>\n<li>Stop re-parsing dates in isStatusStillActive by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11574\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11574</a></li>\n<li>APP-2975: Fix Fabric focus navigation use-after-free by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11583</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for 18 components with value blocks inside try by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11548\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11548</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for 23 components across ten small causes by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11542\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11542</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for 5 components with early exits inside try by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11547\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11547</a></li>\n<li>Fix hairline borders not visible by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11527\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11527</a></li>\n<li>Add known likers to feed posts by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11595\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11595</a></li>\n<li>APP-2996: clean up Expo fetch network errors by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11611</a></li>\n<li>Preserve composer focus when adding thread posts by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11605\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11605</a></li>\n<li>Swap order of Keep editing and Discard buttons by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11606\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11606</a></li>\n<li>Unblock React Compiler for 5 components by removing render-phase mutation by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11543\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11543</a></li>\n<li>Update <code>useAutoPagination</code> max attempts value by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11623\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11623</a></li>\n<li>APP-2983: Fix RTL post alignment on native by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11600\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11600</a></li>\n<li>Stabilize native composer focus by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11624\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11624</a></li>\n<li>Bump the actions group with 2 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11618\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11618</a></li>\n<li>Bump actions/setup-java from 5.7.0 to 6.0.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a